<div id="recipe-83972-instructions" class="wprm-recipe-instructions-container wprm-recipe-83972-instructions-container wprm-block-text-normal" data-recipe="83972"><h3 class="wprm-recipe-header wprm-recipe-instructions-header wprm-block-text-bold wprm-align-left wprm-header-decoration-none" style="">Instructions</h3><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-group"><ul class="wprm-recipe-instructions"><li id="wprm-recipe-83972-step-0-0" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Preheat your oven to 325 &deg;F (162 &deg;C). Fill a casserole dish (I used a 9X13) with 2 cups of hot tap water and place it on the bottom shelf of your oven.</div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="400" height="248" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Egg-bites-cottage-cheese-400x248.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="A casserole dish filled with water in the oven." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Egg-bites-cottage-cheese-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Egg-bites-cottage-cheese-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Egg-bites-cottage-cheese-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Egg-bites-cottage-cheese.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Egg-bites-cottage-cheese.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-83972-step-0-1" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Line a 12-cup muffin tin with parchment liners* or spray them with nonstick cooking spray. Set it aside.</div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="400" height="248" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Easy-egg-bites-with-cottage-cheese-400x248.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="A collage of images showing the egg and cottage cheese mixture." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Easy-egg-bites-with-cottage-cheese-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Easy-egg-bites-with-cottage-cheese-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Easy-egg-bites-with-cottage-cheese-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Easy-egg-bites-with-cottage-cheese.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Easy-egg-bites-with-cottage-cheese.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-83972-step-0-2" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;">In a large mixing bowl, whisk eggs with black pepper until well beaten.</span></div></li><li id="wprm-recipe-83972-step-0-3" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;">Fold in the cottage cheese and shredded cheddar cheese. Mix until the cheese is evenly distributed. Add the baby spinach and mix until well combined.</span></div></li><li id="wprm-recipe-83972-step-0-4" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Divide the egg mixture evenly among 12 muffin cups (a little more than &frac14; cup each).</div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="400" height="248" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Egg-bite-recipe-with-cottage-cheese-400x248.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="Muffin tin with egg and cottage cheese bites before and after they are baked." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Egg-bite-recipe-with-cottage-cheese-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Egg-bite-recipe-with-cottage-cheese-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Egg-bite-recipe-with-cottage-cheese-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Egg-bite-recipe-with-cottage-cheese.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Egg-bite-recipe-with-cottage-cheese.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-83972-step-0-5" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Bake for 35-40 minutes or until a toothpick inserted in the center of an egg bite comes out clean.</div></li><li id="wprm-recipe-83972-step-0-6" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Cool for 10 minutes, then remove the muffins from the muffin pan and transfer them to a platter. Serve warm.</div></li></ul></div></div>
